---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { posts } from '../../data/posts';
---
<BaseLayout title="管理儀表板｜拾光誌">
  <main class="container admin-shell"><div class="eyebrow">CONTENT MANAGEMENT</div><h1 class="serif">管理儀表板</h1><p class="muted">UI Prototype · 以下數字為示範資料</p><div class="admin-stats"><div class="stat"><span class="muted">文章總數</span><strong>{posts.length}</strong></div><div class="stat"><span class="muted">已發布</span><strong>{posts.length}</strong></div><div class="stat"><span class="muted">草稿</span><strong>2</strong></div></div><div class="admin-panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2 class="serif">快速管理</h2><div><a class="text-link" href="/admin/posts/">文章管理 →</a>　<a class="text-link" href="/admin/news/">新聞管理 →</a></div></div><p>目前網站使用靜態示範資料，尚未連接 Supabase Auth 與資料庫。</p><a class="button" href="/admin/posts/">管理文章</a></div><div class="admin-panel"><h2 class="serif">最近文章</h2><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr><th>文章標題</th><th>分類</th><th>狀態</th><th>日期</th></tr></thead><tbody>{posts.slice(0,4).map(p=><tr><td>{p.title}</td><td>{p.category}</td><td><span class="status">展示中</span></td><td>{p.date}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></main>
</BaseLayout>